module HelloWorld

// Welcome to Grain! 🌾
// Grain is a strongly-typed functional programming language that compiles to WebAssembly.
//
// Every Grain file begins with a module declaration:
//   module <ModuleName>
//
// To run this file directly:
//   grain hello_world.gr
//
// To compile to WebAssembly (.wasm):
//   grain compile hello_world.gr -o hello_world.wasm
//   grain run hello_world.wasm

print("Hello, world from Grain!")
print("Grain compiles directly to WebAssembly!")
